<td>Manually replace levels with "other"</td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 25%;"><a href="fct_recode.html">fct_recode</a></td>
<td>Change factor levels by hand</td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 25%;"><a href="fct_relabel.html">fct_relabel</a></td>
<td>Relabel factor levels with a function, collapsing as necessary</td></tr>
