<tr><td style="width: 25%;"><a href="fct_shuffle.html">fct_shuffle</a></td>
<td>Randomly permute factor levels</td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 25%;"><a href="fct_unify.html">fct_unify</a></td>
<td>Unify the levels in a list of factors</td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 25%;"><a href="fct_unique.html">fct_unique</a></td>
<td>Unique values of a factor, as a factor</td></tr>
