Zone Atlantic/Cape_Verde -1:34:04 -	LMT	1912 Jan 01  2:00u # Praia
			-2:00	-	-02	1942 Sep
			-2:00	1:00	-01	1945 Oct 15
			-2:00	-	-02	1975 Nov 25  2:00
			-1:00	-	-01

