# predecessor organization, the European Communities.
# For brevity they are called "EU rules" elsewhere in this file.

# Rule	NAME	FROM	TO	-	IN	ON	AT	SAVE	LETTER/S
Rule	EU	1977	1980	-	Apr	Sun>=1	 1:00u	1:00	S
