Rule Louisville	1946	only	-	Jun	2	2:00	0	S
Rule Louisville	1950	1961	-	Apr	lastSun	2:00	1:00	D
Rule Louisville	1950	1955	-	Sep	lastSun	2:00	0	S
Rule Louisville	1956	1961	-	Oct	lastSun	2:00	0	S
