</head>

<body>
<h1>Theory and pragmatics of the <code><abbr>tz</abbr></code> code and data</h1>
  <h3>Outline</h3>
  <nav>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#scope">Scope of the <code><abbr>tz</abbr></code>
	  database</a></li>
      <li><a href="#naming">Timezone identifiers</a></li>
