      <li><a href="#accuracy">Accuracy of the <code><abbr>tz</abbr></code>
	  database</a></li>
      <li><a href="#functions">Time and date functions</a></li>
      <li><a href="#stability">Interface stability</a></li>
      <li><a href="#leapsec">Leap seconds</a></li>
